<title>SPAIN: Spain's Repsol opens flat at 6,010 ptas.</title>
<headline>Spain's Repsol opens flat at 6,010 ptas.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish energy group Repsol opened unchanged on Tuesday at 6,010 pesetas after the close of the sale of the state's final 10 percent stake.</p>
<p>Late on Monday, Repsol said it had set its retail share offer price at 5,803 pesetas, with the institutional tranche set at 6,010 pesetas per share.</p>
<p>The IBEX-35 share index was up 28.21 points, or 0.49 percent to 5,785.69.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
